%   }
%   else {
None co-located in shipped code (aggregation only).
%   }
%   if ($peripheral || $weak || $distant) {

Lower priority (full matrix in the web report):
%     if ($peripheral) {
* <%= $peripheral %> in tests/docs/vendored files
%     }
%     if ($weak) {
* <%= $weak %> via an unresolved-snippet guess
%     }
%     if ($distant) {
* <%= $distant %> only at the package root (aggregation)
%     }
%   }

% }
% if (@{$report->{missed_files}}) {

Note: Report is incomplete, reviewers need to create new license patterns for unmatched keywords or ignore false
positives. Each file's estimated risk comes from its highest risk snippet, rising above the predicted license as
similarity drops.


